    "turn_text": "And John is taking a post-all-star game day off after the fun in Washington. But it has been quite an eventful couple of days in Washington and well beyond starting the week with this extraordinary summit in Helsinki, Finland, President Trump meeting with Vladimir Putin. It was an interesting one, Mary Alice, because We didn't really know going in what the goals were. We know that the president wanted to have this meeting, but it wasn't like a Kim Jong Un summit or like, frankly, almost any summit between an American leader and a Russian leader where you know exactly what both sides want. We didn't know what they would be trying to accomplish out of this. But the takeaway ended up being quite a bit more than anyone bargained for. some screaming headlines in the aftermath about how the unprecedented nature of this event and it seemed to be capped by an instance a rare maybe unprecedented instance of an american president citing with a russian president over his own intelligence agencies over his own government",
