    "turn_text": "president said he also said as you heard that it could be other people also that there's a lot of people out there and and as you know that it wasn't just that one comment and he went out of his way on monday to talk about how well he was told this side but once he was told this thing by by dan coach this thing by flat and report and he said that he was very clear in his denial, are you confident that he actually delivered as clear a message as you and your colleagues delivered to Putin directly? Did he actually confront him in a way that you think was adequate for the moment?",
