    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/7/77300.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 45,
    "turn_text": "But he didn't do that when he had the moment to do it in front of the world with Putin standing next to him. I mean, did that bother you? Here you're saying that it was so important that you sent a strong message, a unified message from Capitol Hill to the Russians. And I don't see how you could feel that the president backed you up. I mean, do you feel like the president backed you up?",
