  {
    "episode_id": 77300,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/7/77300.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 47,
    "turn_text": "You know, Senator, you've also written a lot saying that those indictments from the Mueller team were important, that his work is important, and yet the president, even after those new indictments came out, continues to call that special counsel's work a witch hunt. Why does he do that? I mean, are you okay with that?",
