  {
    "episode_id": 77300,
    "turn_file": "/shared/3/projects/podcasts/transcriptionQueue/turns/pol_appearance_episodes_interviews/7/7/77300.jsonl",
    "turn_idx": 49,
    "turn_text": "It doesn't seem like the president is interested in that difference, though. He continually goes back to his electoral college victory, as if it's some insult on his victory. Do you think the",
