    "turn_idx": 51,
    "turn_text": "Well, I don't think the Russians changed the outcome in the election in 2016, but they did seek to interfere in it. I think that's an important distinction. And that's what the indictment that the FBI is moving forward on, regardless of their attempts to interfere in the U.S. elections. And remember, there are other countries doing this, the Chinese aren't doing that, the Japanese aren't doing that, the Belgians aren't doing that, the Africans aren't doing that. This is singularly, we have one bad actor in the world that relates to seeking to interfere in US elections, and that's the Russians.",
