    "turn_text": "Listen, Senator, you're a thoughtful guy and I want to preface that because I think I appreciate the time that you spent serving abroad and the time it took to be away from your family to make this trip to Russia, all of that. I'm just curious though, given the entirety of what you've seen this week, Do you come away saying Congress needs to assert itself more, putting some guardrails on this particular policy, or do you feel like the executive branch and President Trump, they've got this?",
