    "turn_text": "And finally, Senator, I know you need to go. Just sort of a global question on this. Do you just think it's weird that the president continues to hedge his bets when it comes to Vladimir Putin? Shower prays on him publicly. Question his own intelligence community publicly while abroad. Even the cleanup, like you say, take him and his word on it. Do you just think it's weird that this keeps happening with Trump and Putin?",
