    "turn_idx": 65,
    "turn_text": "I think he was working really hard to square a circle. On the one hand saying repeatedly, trying to emphasize the importance of what Russia did and is already doing again, an attack on our democracy, trying to underscore how serious he thinks that issue is, how the Homeland Security Committee is trying to take it seriously, saying more funding mechanisms might need to be put in place, the conversations he's had with intelligence officials about the seriousness of that threat. And then on the other hand saying it was basically okay the president didn't really address it because it's important to have dialogue and there's these other issues. And that is just such a contradiction that",
