    "turn_idx": 70,
    "turn_text": "That's right. And it's not in statements, even strongly worded statements and tweets are one thing, from usual suspects or non-usual suspects, one thing. Action is another. And there's a view in Congress among many Republicans that they've already done a lot to constrain the president. They've taken a bunch of steps. But there's a lot more they could do if they really wanted Congress, Republican and Democratic wanted to truly tie the president's hands or hold his feet to the fire on Russia or anything else. They have many, many more mechanisms at the disposal that they've even hinted at so far.",
