    "turn_idx": 76,
    "turn_text": "That's a long one for these days. All right, well, that does it for this edition of Powerhouse Politics. Thanks to Mary Alice Sparks for coming in and co-hosting today. Special thanks to our entire team, Angie, Yak, and Avery Miller, Trevor Hastings, back behind the controls, Liz Brown, Kaiser. Thanks so much, and we'll be back next week with more Powerhouse Politics.",
